	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_bc10r0301_man3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふだんの　せいかつで
まんぞくできる　つまんない　ヤツが▽
しぜんと　のんびりとか　いうんだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T06:39:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>普段の　生活で
満足できる　つまんない　ヤツが▽
自然と　のんびりとか　いうんだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T06:39:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正
※swanでマップ削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T06:54:38" />
		</CommentCell>
